Third-party components and tools

- The local Python API uses FastAPI and Uvicorn. HTTPX and pytest are used
  for tests and scripted validation. SQLite is accessed through Python's
  standard library. Python dependencies retain their respective licenses.
- The optional macOS client uses Apple SwiftUI, AVFoundation, Vision, Core ML,
  and Speech provided by macOS and Xcode.
- The optional seat-motion detector was evaluated with EVIORA-HAR
  (CC BY-NC 4.0). The archive contains no EVIORA footage or trained weights.
  https://zenodo.org/records/22239523
- OpenAI Codex assisted with implementation, tests, and documentation.
